            "content_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance criteria</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The listed features are documented sufficiently on MDN</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD is updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Interactive example and data repos are updated if appropriate</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The content has been reviewed as needed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">For folks helping with Firefox related documentation</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Set bugs to <code class=\"notranslate\">dev-doc-complete</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add entry to Firefox release notes for enabled/preview features</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add/remove entry to Firefox experimental features page for preference/released features</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related Gecko bugs</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301</a> - Implement Trusted Types support for <code class=\"notranslate\">document.write()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">document.writeln()</code> - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement</code> attributes src/innerText/textContent/text  - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">Window.setInterval()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">setTimeout()</code>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=